workedExamples.question_text:
A regular polygon has an exterior angle of $20^{\circ}$. Find its interior angle $I$.
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[x=1cm,y=1cm,every node/.style={font=\fontsize{10}{12}\selectfont,text=black},draw=black]
\coordinate (V) at (0,0);
\draw (-2,0)--(V)--(1.8,0);
\draw (V)--({2*cos(20)},{2*sin(20)});
\draw (0.8,0) arc[start angle=0,end angle=20,radius=0.8];
\draw ({0.55*cos(20)},{0.55*sin(20)}) arc[start angle=20,end angle=180,radius=0.55];
\path (1.25,0.24) node {$20^{\circ}$};
\path (-0.25,0.8) node {$I$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

